      "description": "Pause or fullscreen; 44px minimum targets.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-room-control\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Pause character movement\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5v14M16 5v14\"/></svg><span>Pause</span></button>",
