  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Our little home",
    "overview": "A quiet fixed-view home pairs an original soft illustrated room with the user's approved pixel characters. Domestic life games, including the user-named Adorable Home reference, inform the calm atmosphere; the room artwork is original. Dusty rose, sage, cream, and honey wood give way to plum ambient light and warm lamps as device-local time changes.\n\nThe main preview replaces the rejected 3D direction. Rounded, legible controls sit outside the illustration, leaving the room and two personal characters as the focus. Approved faces, hairstyles, outfits, colors, expressions, and mole placements remain intact.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Original illustrated room with crisp pixel characters.",
      "Fixed composition with automatic local-time lighting.",
      "Restrained Nunito interface and rounded controls outside the art.",
      "Subtle blinking, with pause and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Local Light Rule",
        "body": "The interface switches to night colors when the calculated night blend exceeds one half; it does not offer a manual theme selector.",
        "section": "colors"
